    "body": "I see the problem. You don't want prose here. But can't we just say `0xF780 + byte - 0x80`?\r\n\r\nIs there a reason I'm not seeing for why we don't just make the number `0xF700`? Is the reason to emphasize that we're trying to get to/from bytes >= 0x80?",
